# AI technical review (Claude Opus 5.5), no native-speaker signoff.
msgid "The desktop installers skip wgpu when it is resolved, so it is never downloaded: they pass ``uv`` an override file containing the single line ``wgpu; sys_platform == \"never\"``. Because the marker never holds, the resolver drops wgpu, and with it ``rendercanvas``, which only wgpu needs."
msgstr "桌面安装程序在依赖解析时跳过 wgpu，因此它永远不会被下载：它们向 ``uv`` 传递一个覆盖文件，其中只有一行 ``wgpu; sys_platform == \"never\"``。由于该标记永远不成立，解析器会去掉 wgpu，以及只有 wgpu 需要的 ``rendercanvas``。"

# AI technical review (Claude Opus 5.5), no native-speaker signoff.
msgid "With pip, install spaCR as usual and then remove wgpu:"
msgstr "使用 pip 时，照常安装 spaCR，然后删除 wgpu："

# AI technical review (Claude Opus 5.5), no native-speaker signoff.
msgid "``pip check`` then reports that spaCR's ``wgpu`` requirement is missing; this is expected, and spaCR draws 3D through OpenGL or the CPU."
msgstr "之后 ``pip check`` 会报告 spaCR 的 ``wgpu`` 依赖缺失；这是预期行为，spaCR 会通过 OpenGL 或 CPU 绘制 3D。"

# AI technical review (Claude Opus 5.5), no native-speaker signoff.
msgid "On Linux with glibc older than 2.28 (check with ``getconf GNU_LIBC_VERSION``), ``pip install spacr`` finds no wgpu wheel and tries to build wgpu from its source release, which fails. pip cannot drop a dependency while it resolves, so install with `uv <https://docs.astral.sh/uv/>`_ and the same override the installers use, inside the activated environment:"
msgstr "在 glibc 早于 2.28 的 Linux 上（用 ``getconf GNU_LIBC_VERSION`` 检查），``pip install spacr`` 找不到 wgpu wheel，会尝试从其源代码发布版构建 wgpu，而这会失败。pip 无法在解析过程中去掉某个依赖，因此请在已激活的环境中使用 `uv <https://docs.astral.sh/uv/>`_ 以及安装程序所用的同一覆盖文件进行安装："

# AI technical review (Claude Opus 5.5), no native-speaker signoff.
msgid "Use the same ``--override no-wgpu.txt`` when upgrading spaCR in that environment. Add ``--dry-run`` to the last command to see the resolved packages, without wgpu, before anything is installed."
msgstr "在该环境中升级 spaCR 时，请使用相同的 ``--override no-wgpu.txt``。在最后一条命令中添加 ``--dry-run``，即可在安装任何内容之前查看解析出的包（不含 wgpu）。"

msgid "Container images"
msgstr "容器镜像"

# AI technical review (Claude Opus 5.5), no native-speaker signoff.
msgid "Two images are published to the GitHub Container Registry as part of every spaCR release, after that version reaches PyPI. Each one is built and then checked before it is pushed: it must report the version its tag claims, it must not run as root, and it must complete one pipeline run on a synthetic field. An image that fails a check is not published, and the workflow run that built it fails."
msgstr "每次 spaCR 发布、且该版本已上传到 PyPI 之后，都会有两个镜像发布到 GitHub Container Registry。每个镜像在推送之前都会先构建再检查：它必须报告其标签所声明的版本，不得以 root 身份运行，并且必须在一个合成视野上完整运行一次流程。未通过检查的镜像不会被发布，构建它的工作流运行会失败。"

# AI technical review (Claude Opus 5.5), no native-speaker signoff.
msgid "The public `GHCR package page <https://github.com/EinarOlafsson/spacr/pkgs/container/spacr>`_ lists available versions. The commands below name the image tags of the spaCR release this page documents. Not every spaCR release has a container image; check the package page before pulling a tag."
msgstr "公开的 `GHCR 软件包页面 <https://github.com/EinarOlafsson/spacr/pkgs/container/spacr>`_ 列出了可用的版本。下面的命令使用本页所记录的 spaCR 版本的镜像标签。并非每个 spaCR 版本都有容器镜像；拉取标签前请先查看软件包页面。"

# AI technical review (Claude Opus 5.5), no native-speaker signoff.
msgid "The images run spaCR without a display: the CLI, the pipelines, cluster jobs and reruns of an earlier analysis with a pinned version. Use the platform installers above to install the desktop application."
msgstr "这些镜像在无显示环境下运行 spaCR：用于 CLI、各流程、集群作业，以及以固定版本重新运行早期分析。如需安装桌面应用，请使用上文的平台安装程序。"

