msgid "The second command runs a real pipeline on a synthetic field and reports one line per check; it needs no model, no GPU and no network."
msgstr "第二条命令会在一个合成视野上运行真实的流程，并为每项检查报告一行；它不需要模型、GPU 或网络。"

msgid "Apptainer and SingularityCE on a cluster"
msgstr "在集群上使用 Apptainer 和 SingularityCE"

msgid "Where a cluster allows Apptainer or SingularityCE but not Docker, repackage the Docker image as one read-only ``.sif`` file. Build from the repository root as an ordinary user, with Apptainer 1.2 or newer or SingularityCE 4.0 or newer:"
msgstr "如果集群允许使用 Apptainer 或 SingularityCE 但不允许使用 Docker，请将 Docker 镜像重新打包为一个只读的 ``.sif`` 文件。请以普通用户身份在仓库根目录中构建，需要 Apptainer 1.2 或更高版本，或 SingularityCE 4.0 或更高版本："

msgid "To start from an image you built yourself, add ``--build-arg BOOTSTRAP=docker-daemon --build-arg IMAGE=spacr:cpu``. The build runs the image's smoke test. If a login node has no user namespaces, build on a workstation and copy the ``.sif`` file over. Where ``/etc/subuid`` lists you but ``newuidmap`` is not installed, add ``--ignore-subuid``."
msgstr "如需从您自己构建的镜像开始，请添加 ``--build-arg BOOTSTRAP=docker-daemon --build-arg IMAGE=spacr:cpu``。构建过程会运行镜像的冒烟测试。如果登录节点没有用户命名空间，请在工作站上构建，然后复制 ``.sif`` 文件。如果 ``/etc/subuid`` 中列有您的账户但未安装 ``newuidmap``，请添加 ``--ignore-subuid``。"

msgid "``--nv`` binds the host NVIDIA driver; the CUDA image needs driver 550 or newer. Unlike Docker, the container runs as you, with your real home mounted: models already in ``~/.cellpose/models`` are found, and run manifests go to ``~/.spacr/runs/``. ``$HOME``, the current folder and ``/tmp`` are available by default; add other data folders with ``--bind``. To use a shared model folder, bind it read-only to ``/models``: ``--bind /shared/cellpose_models:/models:ro``. If a host ``PYTHONPATH`` from a conda or module setup leaks into the container, add ``--cleanenv``."
msgstr "``--nv`` 会绑定主机的 NVIDIA 驱动程序；CUDA 镜像需要 550 或更新版本的驱动程序。与 Docker 不同，容器以您的身份运行，并挂载您真实的主目录：``~/.cellpose/models`` 中已有的模型会被找到，运行清单会写入 ``~/.spacr/runs/``。``$HOME``、当前文件夹和 ``/tmp`` 默认可用；请使用 ``--bind`` 添加其他数据文件夹。如需使用共享的模型文件夹，请将其以只读方式绑定到 ``/models``：``--bind /shared/cellpose_models:/models:ro``。如果来自 conda 或 module 设置的主机 ``PYTHONPATH`` 泄漏到容器中，请添加 ``--cleanenv``。"

msgid "``packaging/apptainer/spacr_slurm.sh`` is a Slurm array job that runs Mask then Measure on one plate per task, from one pair of settings files. Copy it, set ``SIF``, ``PLATES`` (a file with one plate folder per line), ``MASK_SETTINGS`` and ``MEASURE_SETTINGS`` and the ``#SBATCH`` lines for your cluster, then submit it:"
msgstr "``packaging/apptainer/spacr_slurm.sh`` 是一个 Slurm 数组作业，每个任务针对一块孔板依次运行掩膜和测量，使用同一对设置文件。复制该脚本，为您的集群设置 ``SIF``、``PLATES`` （每行一个孔板文件夹的文件）、``MASK_SETTINGS`` 和 ``MEASURE_SETTINGS`` 以及 ``#SBATCH`` 行，然后提交："

msgid "For a CPU partition, remove the ``--gres`` line, replace the ``GPU_FLAG`` line with ``GPU_FLAG=`` and point ``SIF`` at the CPU image."
msgstr "对于 CPU 分区，请删除 ``--gres`` 行，将 ``GPU_FLAG`` 行替换为 ``GPU_FLAG=``，并让 ``SIF`` 指向 CPU 镜像。"

#, fuzzy
msgid "The desktop interface on a cluster node"
msgstr "容器中的桌面界面"

msgid "The GUI needs a display. On a cluster, use one of these:"
msgstr ""

msgid "**X11 forwarding.** Connect with ``ssh -X user@login-node`` (or ``ssh -Y`` for trusted forwarding), start an interactive job with X11 forwarding (for example ``srun --x11 --pty bash`` on Slurm), then run ``spacr``. This works but is slow over long distances."
msgstr ""

msgid "**Open OnDemand desktop or VNC.** Start a remote desktop session from your cluster's Open OnDemand page, or a VNC server on the node, open a terminal inside it and run ``spacr``. This is much faster than forwarding."
msgstr ""

msgid "Qt's X11 plugin needs ``libxcb-cursor.so.0`` and a few related libraries that cluster nodes often lack. Without root, install them into your conda or mamba environment:"
msgstr ""

msgid "or create the environment from ``environment-linux.yaml``, which already lists them. ``spacr`` finds them in the active environment by itself, and names any that are still missing instead of crashing; ``spacr-doctor`` shows the same check as its ``X11 libraries`` row. With root, ``sudo apt install libxcb-cursor0`` (Debian/Ubuntu) or ``sudo dnf install xcb-util-cursor`` (RHEL/Rocky) installs them system-wide."
msgstr ""

msgid "A shared home directory is fine: spaCR keeps its single-window lock and its crash counter per host, so a session on one node never blocks or counts against another."
msgstr ""

msgid "Troubleshooting"
msgstr "故障排除"

msgid "The desktop installers write ``install.log`` inside their private installation root. Windows also writes ``nsis-bootstrap-status.txt`` if the wrapper fails before the Python bootstrap starts. Runtime logs are under ``~/.spacr/logs/spacr.log`` (the equivalent home directory on Windows)."
msgstr "桌面安装程序会将 ``install.log`` 写入其私有安装根目录。如果包装程序在 Python 引导程序启动前失败，Windows 还会写入 ``nsis-bootstrap-status.txt``。运行时日志位于 ``~/.spacr/logs/spacr.log`` （在 Windows 上为相应的主目录）。"

msgid "For a Python installation, run:"
msgstr "对于 Python 安装，请运行："

msgid "Include the installer version, operating system, ``install.log`` and the output of ``spacr-doctor`` when filing a `GitHub issue <https://github.com/EinarOlafsson/spacr/issues>`_."
msgstr "提交 `GitHub 问题 <https://github.com/EinarOlafsson/spacr/issues>`_ 时，请附上安装程序版本、操作系统、``install.log`` 以及 ``spacr-doctor`` 的输出。"

